<title>UK: LIFFE August white sugar delivery totals 779 lots.</title>
<headline>LIFFE August white sugar delivery totals 779 lots.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>A total of 779 lots of white sugar, equivalent to 38,950 tonnes, were delivered against the London August No.5 contract after it expired on Wednesday, the London International Financial Futures Exchange (LIFFE) said.</p>
<p>Details are as follows:</p>
<p>SELLER	   LOTS     BUYER		 PORT</p>
<p>Bache	     311     Fimat		 Immingham</p>
<p>Bache		47     Fimat		 Recife</p>
<p>E D &amp; F Man	20     Fimat		 Antwerp</p>
<p>E D &amp; F Man	58     Fimat		 Dunkirk</p>
<p>E D &amp; F Man	17     Fimat		 Hamburg</p>
<p>E D &amp; F Man     181     Fimat		 Cadiz</p>
<p>E D &amp; F Man	10     Fimat		 Gijon</p>
<p>E D &amp; F Man     109     Fimat		 Santander</p>
<p>E D &amp; F Man	 2     Fimat		 Singapore</p>
<p>Refco		20     Fimat		 Santos</p>
<p>Refco		 4     Fimat		 Rostock</p>
<p>--Christopher Lyddon, London newsroom +44 171 542 7928</p>
